    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## W2 \u2014 Scoping call booking \u00b7 Tax & Treuhand Advisory\n\n**Boundary: automated proposal, human confirm above CHF 15000.**\nCHF 15,000 is roughly where an engagement stops being a recurring compliance mandate a manager can price from the standard packages and becomes a project with genuine scope risk \u2014 about ten to fifteen days of senior time \u2014 so a partner confirms the fee and the scope wording before it is sent. Scored 3/2/4.\n\n### The measurable thing here is travel\nClustering by locality is the whole point. Travel minutes per engagement, before and after, is unambiguous and it converts directly to money \u2014 the easiest result in the whole project to defend.\n\nRecord the unclustered estimate too, or you have nothing to compare against. The **Cluster by locality** node writes both.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "caf04323-8b57-4557-8c61-9653cd5c6bf7",
      "name": "Note 1",
